.\" kubectl-kwd(1) - kwd as a kubectl plugin
.\" Manual page for kubectl-kwd
.TH KUBECTL\-KWD 1 "2026-10-08" "kwd v0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kubectl\-kwd \- run kwd as a kubectl plugin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kubectl kwd
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kubectl\-kwd
is the
.B kwd
CLI packaged under the
.I kubectl-
prefix so kubectl plugin discovery resolves it as
.BR "kubectl kwd" .
It is the same binary and accepts the same commands and flags; see
.BR kwd (1)
for the full manual.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kwd (1),
.BR kubectl (1)
.PP
Project: https://github.com/hrodrig/kwd
